-- T2「关节」主题的收尾：删掉自己的 SITE /AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJOI（连同名下全部），幂等。setup 搭档: joint/setup.mac
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-TEARDOWN-ALIVE
{{WORLD_ANCHOR}}
VAR !sites COLLECT ALL SITE WITH (MATCHWILD(NAME,'/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJOI*')) FOR CE
DO !s VALUES !sites
  !!CE = !s.dbref()
  Q REF
  Q NAME
  DELETE SITE
ENDDO
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite T2 joint: teardown (db8000)'
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-TEARDOWN-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
